# baselayer .gitignore
#
# This repo is the public surface of a broader methodology. Defensive
# ignores below ensure substrate artifacts or session content cannot
# accidentally land here via auto-created symlinks or session writes.

# --- Substrate artifacts (auto-generated by external hooks) ---
# External substrate hooks are opted out via .no-substrate-sync
# sentinel. These ignores remain as belt-and-suspenders in case the
# sentinel is ever removed.
.claude/skills/
.claude/hooks/
.claude/luminaries
.claude/luminaries/
.claude/rules/
.claude/agents/
.claude/SESSION_LOCK
.claude/LAST_SAVE
.claude/verify-markers/
.claude/SAVES/
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- Session artifacts that never ship publicly ---
chronicle/
docs/chronicle/
docs/linkedin-drafts/
docs/linkedin-export/
docs/sdlc-traces/
docs/iteration-bets/
docs/audits/
docs/metrics/
docs/danger-mode-summaries/
docs/architecture/reviews/

# --- Private config ---
substrate.config.md
phase-state.md
risk-register.md

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml

# --- Temp / build ---
*.log
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.cache/
